you know?

10
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:28,220
(Penny:)Go to sleep.
Good night.

11
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:37,530
(Howard:)Please tell me
you're not having coitus.

12
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:42,400
